00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:06.620
restores longer quotes when Fable 5 truncates them, then compare output quality against an uncapped

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:15.820
model. Further GPT 5.6 model swaps are expected inside additional Microsoft surfaces. Open AI BioBugged

